{
 "duration": 64.3,
 "exact_word_timing": true,
 "lines": [
  {
   "beat": 0,
   "text": "The message you just sent didn't go to space.",
   "start": 0.15,
   "end": 2.517
  },
  {
   "beat": 0,
   "text": "It went down. To the bottom of the ocean.",
   "start": 2.637,
   "end": 5.068
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "More than ninety-nine percent of data between continents travels through cables on the seafloor.",
   "start": 5.368,
   "end": 11.083
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "Laid end to end, they'd wrap the Earth more than forty times.",
   "start": 11.203,
   "end": 14.625
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "And in the deep ocean, each one is about as thick as a garden hose.",
   "start": 14.925,
   "end": 18.869
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "Inside, glass threads thinner than a hair carry your message as flashes of light.",
   "start": 18.989,
   "end": 23.637
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "So what breaks them?",
   "start": 23.937,
   "end": 25.173
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "You've probably seen a shark biting a cable.",
   "start": 25.293,
   "end": 27.683
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "But in the fault records from 2007 to 2014, fish caused exactly zero breaks.",
   "start": 27.983,
   "end": 34.127
  },
  {
   "beat": 5,
   "text": "The real culprits are fishing gear and ship anchors.",
   "start": 34.427,
   "end": 37.251
  },
  {
   "beat": 5,
   "text": "Around two hundred cable faults happen every year. That's three or four a week.",
   "start": 37.371,
   "end": 42.188
  },
  {
   "beat": 6,
   "text": "And only about sixty ships on Earth can fix them.",
   "start": 42.488,
   "end": 45.324
  },
  {
   "beat": 6,
   "text": "They drop a hook kilometers down, drag it across the seabed,",
   "start": 45.444,
   "end": 48.728
  },
  {
   "beat": 6,
   "text": "and haul the broken cable up into the daylight.",
   "start": 48.848,
   "end": 51.427
  },
  {
   "beat": 7,
   "text": "In 2024, cuts in the Red Sea disrupted about a quarter of the traffic between Europe and Asia.",
   "start": 51.727,
   "end": 58.148
  },
  {
   "beat": 8,
   "text": "So the next time a message arrives in a second,",
   "start": 58.448,
   "end": 60.857
  },
  {
   "beat": 8,
   "text": "remember the garden hose at the bottom of the sea.",
   "start": 60.977,
   "end": 63.6
  }
 ],
